  "step_3": "The decision reason is not applicable because neither lottery is left-skewed — both are right-skewed (higher probability on the zero outcome). The individual did not consider skewness in their reasoning; instead, they focused on the small difference in outcomes and similar probabilities. Since the reason requires evaluating and preferring the more left-skewed lottery, and no such consideration occurred in the verbal report, the decision reason was not used. The individual’s reasoning is based on expected value differences and probability similarity, not on skewness. Therefore, the decision reason was not used.",
